    "background_story": "Gage was a young and ambitious bodybuilder, determined to make a name for himself in the competitive world of fitness. He spent countless hours in the gym, pushing his body to its limits and experimenting with different training techniques. As he delved deeper into the world of bodybuilding, Gage became fascinated with the science behind muscle growth and development. He began to study the effects of anabolic hormones on muscle tissue, learning how to optimize his training and nutrition to maximize his gains. With his newfound knowledge, Gage's physique began to transform, and he started to compete in local bodybuilding competitions. His dedication and expertise earned him a reputation as a rising star in the fitness community, and he soon landed sponsorships and endorsement deals. Gage's passion for anabolic science had taken him from a novice lifter to a champion bodybuilder.",
